5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Yay! A mystery game! I'm so excited to play with everyone! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the werewolf! Who wants to help me?,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minako,,"It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let's start by observing everyone's behavior. Since it is the first day, we have no information, so we should remain calm and patient.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree with Minako. A calm approach is the most rational way to begin. Let us observe each other's patterns and speech carefully before jumping to any conclusions.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready! I'll help you, Sakura, but we have to be smart about it. I'm not just going to guess; I'll keep a close eye on everyone to make sure no one is lying.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's keep things logical. Since we have no information yet, observing everyone's behavior as Minako and Victoria suggested is the most sensible approach.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minako"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, you guys are all so serious! It's like talking to teachers! But okay, I'll be a good detective and watch everyone very, very closely. Do you think the werewolf is hiding in plain sight?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minako,,"It is possible. Often, those who try too hard to blend in or act overly friendly can be hiding something. However, we must not let suspicion cloud our judgment without evidence.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Victoria,,"@Minako, that is a valid point. However, we must also be careful not to mistake natural personality traits for deception. For now, I will focus on the consistency of everyone's statements.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'll do that too! If anyone starts acting weird or changing their story, I'll be the first one to call them out. I'm not letting the werewolf trick us!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"Consistency is key. Let's see how everyone's logic holds up as the game progresses. For now, I'll just be observing.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"I wonder if the Seer is already thinking about who to check tonight! I bet they're super nervous! @Victoria, do you think the Seer will tell us right away, or keep it a secret?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minako,,"It depends on the Seer's strategy. Revealing themselves early can provide a clear lead, but it also makes them a target for the werewolf. I believe a cautious approach is generally safer for the village.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Sakura, I believe the Seer will likely keep their identity secret for a while. Revealing themselves too early is a high risk that the village cannot afford if the information is not definitive.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I agree with Victoria. If the Seer comes out too soon, the werewolf will just kill them tonight! We need the Seer to stay alive as long as possible to find the bad guy.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree. Protecting the Seer is our priority. If they can gather a few nights of information before revealing themselves, the village will be in a much stronger position.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"That makes sense! I'll be the Seer's secret bodyguard then! Hehe, just kidding! I'm just going to have fun and watch everyone. I'm ready for the night to come!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Sakura,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Minako,,I agree. Let us conclude the discussion for today and prepare for the first night. I look forward to seeing how the information unfolds tomorrow.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Minako,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Victoria,,I believe we have established a sound foundation for our observation. I shall spend the night reflecting on our initial interactions. I am ready.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Victoria,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm ready too! I'll be thinking about everything everyone said today. Whoever the werewolf is, they won't get away with it! I'm ready for the night!","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I agree. Let's see what information we have tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
